<doctext field_name="doctext">Didn't you rather want to use &lt;C&gt;+&lt;/C&gt; instead of &lt;C&gt;*&lt;/C&gt; ?
 
&lt;c&gt;
  DB&lt;48&gt; p "hello\nfoo" =~ s/o*$/O/gmr;
hellOO
fOO
  DB&lt;49&gt; p "hello\nfoo" =~ s/o+$/O/gmr;
hellO
fO
  DB&lt;50&gt;
&lt;/c&gt;&lt;P&gt;

